SUMMARY:AMA: Bitfury\, HackerOne & Gonka — Bug Bounty Program Launch
DESCRIPTION:Second community AMA session with Vadim Krutov (COO of Bitfury)
  and David Liberman. The meeting focuses on breaking down the launch of th
 e joint Bug Bounty program.\n\n👥 SPEAKERS\n🔥 NEW GUEST: Laurie Merce
 r\, HackerOne Senior Director of Sales Engineering\, joins the AMA session
 !\n• Vadim Krutov — COO of Bitfury\n• @libermans — David Liberman\
 n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT NOTE: THIS SESSION IS HELD ENTIRELY IN ENGLISH. ⚠️
